    <comment>Wallet error in the apps, when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns no_account: the chosen wallet shared no account it can sign with (none is connected to the site, or it holds only accounts of another chain), so nothing was signed. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or WalletConnect on the Bittensor page, Phantom or Solflare on the Solana page).</comment>
