    <comment>Bittensor wallet connect (Earnings), manual entry (TAO.com, or Talisman on a phone): the server refused the pasted signature because it does not verify for the address the user typed over the shown message (POST /sn/wallet error.code signature_mismatch). Usually the user signed with another account in the wallet. The server cannot tell which account signed. The argument is the wallet product name (TAO.com or Talisman).</comment>
